    {
      "id": "claim_c83cf3ce9d814b839ea262b41d76bd80",
      "statement": "Tailscale's default segmentation offload (TSO/GSO/GRO) on its own tun device collapsed outbound tailnet throughput for every peer while leaving small-packet latency, loss and every conventional counter clean; disabling the offloads took one identical fetch from ~117 KB/s to 84.5 MB/s. The fix must be bound to device creation (a systemd unit keyed to `sys-subsystem-net-devices-tailscale0.device`) because both a reboot and a `tailscaled` restart reset the flags.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/runbooks/prod-reboot-resilience.md#L33-L78",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ccb1e487bd13b08188c6bb39d06e45e83ed55ebecb6630ac24760273ed025dd3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_74f0837fc5894aacba001ee4b1c807c5",
      "statement": "Two measurement traps manufactured false conclusions in the tailnet throughput diagnosis: PowerShell `Invoke-WebRequest` is roughly 40× slower than `curl.exe` on the same fetch, and a shell session into the host over the tailnet is Tailscale SSH, which terminates inside `tailscaled` without traversing the tun and so can never serve as a throughput probe.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/runbooks/prod-reboot-resilience.md#L73-L76",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7cf065d62a2c16f84d65f7727626216c8bfcfe4f9e9e25aef92b58e318eb254c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1e983947865e4119937fc4e544cf8542",
      "statement": "When a reboot lands dirty, nothing self-heals until Komodo can act again, and the manual recovery order is: start Komodo periphery (Core otherwise has no agent and can redeploy nothing, including itself), start Forgejo (Komodo clones the repo from it on every sync), then run Komodo's Execute Sync (which re-clones into the persistent periphery root and recreates every stack with its declared networks).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/runbooks/prod-reboot-resilience.md#L193-L195",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bc4d900ed89e0ad5d49c18ab241535bd9a9249071b6d52d357943200b234a76a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_df2855db01854b05b754cfa746e1807c",
      "statement": "`scripts/check-prod-ci-port-collision.mjs` splits compose files by basename (prod = `*.prod.yaml`, CI/dev = everything else its globs discover) and compares fixed host port *numbers* while ignoring the bind interface, because a prod `0.0.0.0` bind collides with a CI bind on the same number whatever interface the CI side names; it skips entries with no deterministic fixed host port and expands numeric ranges. Discovery is by glob plus basename classification, so a compose file whose name does not start with `compose` and does not live under `stacks/` falls outside the scan entirely.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/check-prod-ci-port-collision.mjs#L102-L127",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6bd7a6688e51eff82c967e028de1f1b303a6b964fa63ccf45ea88989c6a5f13c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/check-prod-ci-port-collision.mjs#L34-L64",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6959b2e6479b675c37abe8ea9589c65ce1e4786a57f1737061de89aad244de71:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6e5bee37ab004422bfb0587bcb415fea",
      "statement": "`scripts/check-prod-restart-policy.mjs` makes `restart: always` a required property of every prod service: `unless-stopped` is forbidden (the round-2 regression) and a missing `restart:` is forbidden because it defaults to `no`, while `no`/`on-failure` are allowed only for genuine one-shot containers whose names match the init/seed/`rs-init`/`createbucket` pattern. Its scan globs only `infrastructure-as-code/docker/**/compose.prod.yaml`, so it cannot police host-managed composes living outside the repository.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/check-prod-restart-policy.mjs#L11-L23",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3d49df632dc3b9a38761aaf9ddbc06591bbb985dfa645530f775e0e4c7a8d2e9:"
        },
        {
