        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/check-prod-restart-policy.mjs#L58-L71",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a5a49813114aa1005a40c00ffa58e41644d131ae38b7a530d95314350bef3268:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bc06b4a40d8f4ea3bb3be21f96b011c9",
      "statement": "Both reboot-resilience gates run selftest-then-scan in the `naming` job of `.forgejo/workflows/guardrails.yml` on every PR and every push to `main`, and locally through `scripts/preflight.mjs`; each gate's `--selftest` plants a violation so a gate that stopped detecting cannot report green.",
      "evidence": [
