    {
      "id": "claim_3ada407592c3476b9302af6783b1dcba",
      "statement": "A validation reboot is part of the change rather than a follow-up: after merging and syncing, the operator reboots once and every row of the checklist must pass on the first boot with no manual `docker start` or `docker network connect`, and any failing row is a defect to fix before closing the round.",
