    {
      "id": "claim_361318d50da04f13a45d9b210a7f252c",
      "statement": "One-shot init containers in the prod composes idle on `sleep infinity` after an idempotent init so they remain eligible for `restart: always`, which is why the `no`/`on-failure` exemption in the restart-policy gate is narrow rather than general.",
